      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "EXAMPLE: CPU-ONLY KLING LAYER EDITING\n\n1. Load any previously generated Kling image.\n2. RemBG (first use may download a free model) generates foreground mask.\n3. Extract Layer uses original RGB and mask to isolate subject.\n4. Move Layer offsets extracted subject 80 pixels right.\n5. Inpaint Background uses OpenCV CPU to approximate hidden pixels.\n6. Composite overlays the moved subject on the repaired background.\n7. Preview + Save Image writes the result to output/Kling_CPU_Layers/.\n\nNo Kling or Seedream API required for the edits. This is NOT Kling Studio's proprietary layer editor. Thin lace and large masked areas may cause artifacts. Text is not a native editable text layer."
      ],
      "title": "README / Limitations"
    }
